# Webleau

Spatial node/link canvas (Liquid Space / `LQS`). Start with `AGENTS.md` for architecture.

## Change policy

- Nothing is sacred: refactor, remove, rearchitect freely.
- No backwards compatibility for layouts, events, quines, or APIs unless the human asks.
- Prefer deleting old paths over compatibility shims.
- Ask when the intended end state is ambiguous; otherwise implement fully.

## Orientation

- App code: `js/lqs/` — `core.js` (controller), `node.js` (cards), `node-*.js` (types).
- Boot: `index.php` lists script/style order; `?debug=1` loads files separately.
- Mutations: prefer `lqs.change(event)` over ad-hoc DOM/state edits.
- Vendor under `js/` and `css/jquery-ui.css`: replace, do not hand-edit minified blobs.
- No package manager/tests yet; introducing a real toolchain is welcome when the task justifies it.

## When architecture changes

Update `AGENTS.md` and these rules so the next session stays accurate.
